cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "trendlab: trend detection and robustness checks for gridded environmental time series"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "[ĐIỀN: tên nhóm hoặc tên tác giả]"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/PTBK147/trendlab"
abstract: >-
  Python package and analysis scripts for detecting historical trends in gridded
  time series (Mann-Kendall, Sen's slope, Hamed-Rao correction, FDR control) and
  for checking how robust the detected trends are. Applied to GPM IMERG rainfall
  over the Amazon basin, 2001-2024, for NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026
  "Earth System Trend Detective".